OL,3,AKing describes slave trade as 'shameful
OL,4,Achapter' that 'fills my heart with
OL,5,Ahorror' in Commonwealth speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles addresses the slave trade
OL,8,Fin a speech to Commonwealth leaders,
OL,9,Fsaying the "shameful chapter of history
OL,10,Fis one that fills my heart with horror"
OL,12,FHe was formally opening the
OL,13,FCommonwealth Heads of Government
OL,14,FMeeting (Chogm) in Antigua and Barbuda
OL,16,FThe King also outlines what he
OL,17,Fdescribes as the "crisis of our time",
OL,18,Fciting "brutal conflicts" facing the
OL,19,Fworld, the "catastrophic reality" of
OL,20,Fclimate change and the "dizzying speed"
OL,21,Fat which technology is transforming
OL,22,Fsocieties
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
