OL,3,AKing describes slave trade as 'shameful
OL,4,Achapter' that 'fills my heart with
OL,5,Ahorror' in Commonwealth speech
OL,6,
OL,7,FBritish Prime Minister Andy Burnham is
OL,8,Falso at the summit, saying he is "open"
OL,9,Fto a formal apology from the UK over
OL,10,Fslavery, but said reparations were "not
OL,11,Fthe right answer"
OL,13,FAs part of talks with fellow leaders,
OL,14,FBurnham is expected to set out plans
OL,15,Ffor a "debt reset" to support
OL,16,FCommonwealth countries dealing with the
OL,17,Fgrowing cost of paying interest
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
